course: dictionary
lesson: 14660
title: Preferably: the best choice
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: «Preferably» means if possible, or it would be better if. It tells you the best choice when you could pick more than one way, or what is ideal but not required.
explain: «Come early, preferably before nine.» Coming before nine is the better plan, but it is not a rule. If you cannot manage it, you can still come. The word shows a wish, not an order.
explain: «Use a pencil, preferably a sharp one.» A sharp pencil is the better choice, but a blunt one still works. To check, swap in if possible: «Use a pencil, if possible a sharp one.» If the sentence still makes sense, you have the right meaning.
fact: «Preferably» is an adverb, so it tells you how or when something is best done.
fact: «Preferably» means if possible, or it would be better if.
fact: «Preferably» can also mean chosen or liked more than other ways.
fact: Common phrases are «preferably not», «preferably before» and «preferably in».
fact: A good check is to swap in «if possible» and see if the sentence still makes sense.
exercise: «Come early, preferably before nine.» What does preferably mean? | Never, not at all | Only if you are told to | Very loudly | *If possible, it would be better
exercise: «Use a pencil, preferably a sharp one.» Which pencil is the best choice? | A pencil with no point at all | *A sharp one, if you can get one | A broken one | A pen instead
exercise: Mum says, «Please wait outside, preferably in the shade.» Where would she like you to wait? | Inside the car with the engine on | *In the shade, if there is a choice | Under the hot sun | In the middle of the path
test: Which word means if possible, or it would be better if? | *Preferably | Barely | Ancient | Curt
test: Dad says, «Dinner at six, preferably not later.» What does preferably not later mean? | Dinner is at seven exactly | Dinner is cancelled | Dinner must be after six | *It is better if dinner is not later than six
exam: The recipe says, «Wash the apples, preferably with a brush.» What does the recipe suggest? | *Use a brush if you can, because it is the better way | Peel the apples first | You must use a brush, with no other way allowed | Do not wash the apples at all
